{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"稳定同伦论","text":"稳定同伦论"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Sp"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Sp"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"谱","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"的范畴 $\\mathsf{Sp}$ 是最基本的"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定无穷范畴","text":"稳定 $\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":", 是"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"的范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" 的"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定化","text":"稳定化"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Sp} := \\lim\\Big(\\cdots\\overset{\\Omega}{\\longrightarrow} \\mathsf{Ani}_*\r\n\\overset{\\Omega}{\\longrightarrow} \\mathsf{Ani}_*\\Big)\r\n\\in \\mathsf{Cat}_{\\infty}.\r\n$$\n其构造思路大致是: 从带基点"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani_pt","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}_*$"}},{"Plain":" 开始, 强行让"},{"Local":{"url":"纬悬","text":"纬悬"}},{"Plain":" $\\Sigma$ 变得可逆, 得到一个新的范畴.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Sp}$ 上有"},{"Local":{"url":"压缩积","text":"压缩积"}},{"Plain":" $\\wedge$ 与映射谱 $[-,-]$ 给出的"},{"Local":{"url":"闭范畴","text":"闭"}},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"对称幺半"}},{"Plain":"结构. 有"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"对称幺半函子"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n(\\mathsf{Set},\\times) \\to (\\mathsf{Ani},\\times) \\overset{(-)_+}{\\to} (\\mathsf{Ani}_{*/},\\wedge) \\overset{\\Sigma_{\\infty}}{\\to} (\\mathsf{Sp},\\wedge).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}